1
00:00:00,174 --> 00:00:03,054
(Penny:)Well, some people just can't handle
that kind of relationship.

2
00:00:04,011 --> 00:00:05,721
(Sheldon:)Can you?

3
00:00:07,723 --> 00:00:09,183
(Penny:)Excuse me?

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:13,980
(Sheldon:)Are you able to have sex with men without
developing an emotional attachment?

5
00:00:14,146 --> 00:00:18,646
Sheldon, I really don't wanna
talk about this with you.

6
00:00:18,817 --> 00:00:20,857
(Sheldon:)Is this conversation
making you uncomfortable?

7
00:00:21,028 --> 00:00:23,448
(Penny:)Of course it's making me uncomfortable.
Can't you tell?

8
00:00:23,614 --> 00:00:25,034
(Sheldon:)I really have no idea.

9
00:00:25,199 --> 00:00:27,949
(Sheldon:)I don't particularly excel
at reading facial expressions...

10
00:00:28,118 --> 00:00:30,458
(Penny:)I'm uncomfortable, Sheldon!

11
00:00:32,039 --> 00:00:34,289
(Sheldon:)Thank you, that's very helpful.

12
00:00:36,961 --> 00:00:39,631
All right,
where are these amazing shrimp?

13
00:00:40,381 --> 00:00:41,841
(Leonard:)Behold.

14
00:00:43,926 --> 00:00:47,766
Seriously?
You think this is the size of a baby's arm?

15
00:00:48,722 --> 00:00:50,602
(Raj:)A little baby.

16
00:00:51,684 --> 00:00:52,934
(Howard:)I'm going back to the room.

17
00:00:53,477 --> 00:01:07,027
(Michaela(arriving):)Boy, would it maybe kill them
to put out a nice brisket?

